    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      437.35,
      286.53,
      548.46
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: Below mentioned lands in total extent of about 0.0677 Hectare, Preliminary Plan No. K 4509, prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Survey of Kaluthara District on behalf of Survey General, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of 822 F, Kongasthanna in the village of Halwathura in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Bulathsinghala in Kaluthara District in the Western Province.",
